# circal's optional cloud copy (`SYNC.md` Phase 2). Copy to `.env` to switch it
# on; leave it unset and the feature is *absent* — no fetch, no dead UI, no
# error, and the bundle byte-identical. A fork or a self-hoster who never sets
# these gets exactly the app they had before it existed.
#
# Astro inlines `PUBLIC_*` into the client bundle, which is where both of these
# belong: the publishable key is a public identifier, not a secret. It says
# which project a request is for and reaches the database with no more
# authority than an unauthenticated visitor has — row level security is what
# keeps one user's row out of another user's reach (see
# `supabase/migrations/*_documents.sql`). Hiding it would buy no security and
# would need a Worker route to proxy through, which `AGENTS.md` refuses.
#
# Supabase issues this as `sb_publishable_…` on the project's API Keys page.
# The `sb_secret_…` key sitting beside it is its opposite: it bypasses row
# level security entirely, so it must never be a `PUBLIC_*` variable, never
# reach a browser, and never be pasted here. The old `anon` / `service_role`
# JWTs are the same pair under the project's Legacy tab; a publishable key is
# not a JWT, which is why this variable is no longer named `ANON_KEY`.
#
# The payload is sealed client-side by `src/lib/vault.ts` before it is ever
# sent, so neither of these values, and no breach of the project behind them,
# reaches a plaintext calendar.
#
# circal's own project is `lguckvebxsoplpfejyjc`, region `eu-central-1`, so the
# URL this repo expects is `https://lguckvebxsoplpfejyjc.supabase.co`. It is
# named here rather than left to a wiki because the migration in
# `supabase/migrations/` has been applied to that project and nowhere else, and
# a second project with the same schema is a second calendar nobody is looking
# at. The key is still left as a placeholder: read the current one out of the
# dashboard, since it can be rotated and a stale one committed here would be
# read as authoritative.

PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://lguckvebxsoplpfejyjc.supabase.co
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_your-publishable-key
